# Top-level folders and files on the gh-pages branch that a deploy from main
# leaves alone. Everything else at the root is replaced by the new build, and
# whatever the build no longer produces is deleted.
#
# One name per line, relative to the root of gh-pages, no leading slash.
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored. A trailing / means a
# folder. `branches/` (the branch previews) and `.git` are always kept, whether
# or not they are listed here.
branches/
